    <ul>
      <li>Functions eliminate code duplication and reduce maintenance burden</li>
      <li>One function = one clear responsibility, tested once, used everywhere</li>
      <li>DRY principle: if code is repeated, encapsulate it in a function</li>
      <li>Functions make code more readable and easier to reason about</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
